---
import { PAIR_SELECTIONS } from '../data/pairSelections';
---
<figure aria-labelledby="chain-diagram-caption">
  <p class="meta">Proposed structure / No live ONCALL pools</p>
  <ol class="flow">
    <li><span class="step meta">01 / Origin</span><strong>ONCALL token</strong><span class="meta">Contract PENDING</span></li>
    <li><span class="step meta">02 / Markets</span><strong>Five Uniswap v4 pools</strong><span class="meta">Every pool PENDING</span></li>
    <li><span class="step meta">03 / Quotes</span><strong>Five selected quote assets</strong><ul>{PAIR_SELECTIONS.map(({ symbol }) => <li>{symbol}</li>)}</ul></li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption id="chain-diagram-caption">ONCALL token → five Uniswap v4 pools → five selected quote assets. A planned connection map for the selected identities, with every PAR and route/depth check PENDING; it does not represent asset backing or tracking.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  figure { margin: 2rem 0; padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 2rem); border: 1px solid var(--ink); background: var(--paper-raised); }
  .flow { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-block: 1.5rem; }
  .flow > li { position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.6rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 3px solid var(--teal); }
  .flow > li + li::before { content: '→'; position: absolute; left: -1.3rem; top: 1rem; }
  strong { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.15; }
  ul { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; list-style: none; padding: 0; font-family: var(--font-meta); font-size: 0.75rem; }
  ul li { border: 1px solid var(--rule); padding: 0.15rem 0.3rem; }
  figcaption { font-size: 0.95rem; }
  @media (max-width: 42rem) { .flow { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 2rem; } .flow > li + li::before { content: '↓'; left: 0; top: -1.9rem; } }
</style>
